{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped on an island ruled by a ruthless <strong>dictator</strong>\u2026 well, no one really knows his name. No one knows who he is\u2014he\u2019s never appeared anywhere in person. He\u2019s sealed every escape route: the docks are shut and the boats are burned. You, being an ex\u2013art thief, tried to escape, but here\u2026 nothing goes without consequences (you lost your left eye). It\u2019s only been three weeks since you arrived <i>accidentally</i>, and already the island feels like a prison that\u2019s slowly learning <u>your name</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the village, <strong>help</strong> the villagers, try to regain your sight, <strong>complete</strong> interesting missions and make friends on the island (you will need them later xdddd).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover the island\u2019s <span class=\"bb_strike\">secrets</span>, you\u2019ll need to use your strategic thinking, and your <i>thief</i>\u2019s instincts to survive. Sneak through guarded areas (well the guards are pretty bad at their work but still...) and make moral choices that does not affect how others see you (hmmm sad). </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112420?t=1763888524","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112420?t=1763888524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112420/4ac288862648227fea0a3feddb9d6c323f93c3e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763888524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112420/4ac288862648227fea0a3feddb9d6c323f93c3e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763888524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"A bit of pixellated blood always visible on the screen."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped on an island ruled by a ruthless <strong>dictator</strong>\u2026 well, no one really knows his name. No one knows who he is\u2014he\u2019s never appeared anywhere in person. He\u2019s sealed every escape route: the docks are shut and the boats are burned. You, being an ex\u2013art thief, tried to escape, but here\u2026 nothing goes without consequences (you lost your left eye). It\u2019s only been three weeks since you arrived <i>accidentally</i>, and already the island feels like a prison that\u2019s slowly learning <u>your name</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the village, <strong>help</strong> the villagers, try to regain your sight, <strong>complete</strong> interesting missions and make friends on the island (you will need them later xdddd).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover the island\u2019s <span class=\"bb_strike\">secrets</span>, you\u2019ll need to use your strategic thinking, and your <i>thief</i>\u2019s instincts to survive. Sneak through guarded areas (well the guards are pretty bad at their work but still...) and make moral choices that does not affect how others see you (hmmm sad). </p>","developers":["nhun"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112420/f0206e261096b6b2ff70d861d8a33fa39343bcc1/header.jpg?t=1763888524","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4112420/1803079980/747d2792efc90fc30c2b2591868762d03508a8c7/1763734264/dash_av1.mpd?t=176373